@startuml corporate-comms-broadcast
title Corporate Communication — Buat/Edit Artikel → Broadcast Notifikasi
' Sumber: prd-dashboard.md §5.9 (FR-ADM-COM-*). add-corporate-comms (reuse send_bulk).

actor Admin
participant "rejki-web\n(Corporate Communication)" as web
participant "require_admin" as rbac
participant "corporate-comms service" as svc
participant "StorageClient" as stor
database "schema comms\n(corporate_article)" as db
participant "NotificationClient" as notif
actor "Seluruh Pengguna\n(in-app)" as users

alt Buat Artikel baru
  Admin -> web : klik "Buat Artikel" (Judul, Isi, Kategori=informasi, Foto)
  web -> rbac : POST /admin/articles (Bearer admin)
  rbac -> svc : role=admin OK
  svc -> stor : presigned upload foto → object_key
  svc -> db : insert corporate_article (author=sesi admin, read-only)
  svc -> notif : send_bulk(all_users, "Artikel baru terbit")
else Sunting Artikel
  Admin -> web : klik ikon Pena → edit → Simpan
  web -> svc : PUT /admin/articles/{id}
  svc -> db : update (+ updated_at)
  svc -> notif : send_bulk(all_users, "Artikel diperbarui")
end

notif -> users : notifikasi in-app

note over svc
  Pembuat artikel read-only (otomatis dari sesi).
  Kategori dropdown: saat ini hanya `informasi`.
  Hapus via ikon Tong Sampah. Search by judul, sort by kategori.
end note
@enduml
